w can we do that?","type":"text"}],"title":"Define information cards","estimatedTime":"45min"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries":{"title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","type":"section","kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several libraries for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These libraries help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-libraries#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},"tutorial-onboarding-3-1.png":{"alt":"A simple view with some component inside","identifier":"tutorial-onboarding-3-1.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-1.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further":{"abstract":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"10min","type":"topic","title":"Going further with more resources","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further","role":"project"},"tutorial-onboarding-3-8-LiquidGlass.png":{"alt":"A view with a tab bar in the bottom","identifier":"tu